sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Nguoi dung
    participant UI as OpeningBalanceImportView
    participant VM as OpeningBalanceImportViewModel
    participant ImportSvc as OpeningBalanceImportService / DynamicImportService
    participant Parser as ExcelImportService / CsvImportService
    participant Posting as InventoryPostingService
    participant DB as SQL Server
    User->>UI: Chon file Excel/CSV
    UI->>VM: ImportCommand(filePath, mapping)
    VM->>ImportSvc: ImportFile(filePath, userId)
    ImportSvc->>Parser: Parse rows
    Parser-->>ImportSvc: ImportResult + RowError
    alt Du lieu hop le
        ImportSvc->>DB: Tao/ghep danh muc, san pham, serial, chung tu
        ImportSvc->>Posting: PostStockIn/PostStockOut neu can ghi so
        Posting->>DB: Cap nhat StockBalance, ProductSerial, StockLedger, AuditLog
        ImportSvc-->>VM: Thanh cong + thong ke
    else Co loi
        ImportSvc-->>VM: Danh sach loi dong
        VM-->>UI: Hien thi ImportResultWindow
    end
